{"id":27,"imdb":"tt0411705","en":"9 Songs","orig":"9 Songs","ar":null,"tag":"2 lovers, one summer, and the 9 songs that defined them.","ov":"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.","rd":"2004-07-16","rt":70,"g":[18,10402,10749],"lang":"en","budget":1000000,"revenue":1574623,"companies":[{"n":"Revolution Films","logo":null,"c":"GB"}],"countries":["GB"],"langs":["English"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"GB","d":"2004-07-16"},{"c":"ES","d":"2004-09-23"},{"c":"DE","d":"2005-01-20"},{"c":"IE","d":"2005-02-12"},{"c":"FR","d":"2005-03-02"},{"c":"IS","d":"2005-04-15"},{"c":"AT","d":"2005-05-13"},{"c":"US","d":"2006-07-25"},{"c":"KR","d":"2011-10-27"},{"c":"NL","d":"2012-03-15"}],"dir":["Michael Winterbottom"],"prod":["Michael Winterbottom","Andrew Eaton"],"wri":["Michael Winterbottom"],"mus":[],"dop":["Marcel Zyskind"],"cast":[{"n":"Kieran O'Brien","ch":"Matt","p":"/wKYN1MvjYIJTYtXVFtlqWK84SMp.jpg"},{"n":"Margo Stilley","ch":"Lisa","p":"/nUuhYYiKp1Ii0S25PqSxQjfYKMk.jpg"},{"n":"Courtney Taylor-Taylor","ch":"Himself - The Dandy Warhols (uncredited)","p":"/m0lsvVWIAWsli6rvrpsFW6zuVTu.jpg"},{"n":"Alex Kapranos","ch":"Himself - Franz Ferdinand (uncredited)","p":"/kh9k3JQQAXbzTpgZDSY4NigYd4x.jpg"},{"n":"Guy Garvey","ch":"Himself - Elbow (uncredited)","p":"/wm3XN35TBOf2r9K2MLnhhB3dJNP.jpg"},{"n":"Robert Levon Been","ch":"Himself - Black Rebel Motorcycle Club (uncredited)","p":"/epsSibtNsv6df4gHkn6YTOBDzSu.jpg"},{"n":"Peter Hayes","ch":"Himself - Black Rebel Motorcycle Club (uncredited)","p":"/ySKpccq7gQFDvHfdENS0Xde45h4.jpg"},{"n":"Gruff Rhys","ch":"Himself - Super Furry Animals (uncredited)","p":"/motwjtjxsMfVsuQme2qrUbSuH7